OL,3,GNEWSAPeople-smuggling gang used
OL,4,Apassports to control migrants
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive men who used migrants' passports
OL,7,Fas a form of "debt bondage" after
OL,8,Fsmuggling them into the UK have been
OL,9,Fjailed.
OL,11,FThe gang smuggled Vietnamese migrants
OL,12,Finto the country and laundered more
OL,13,Fthan #1.6m, the National Crime Agency
OL,14,F(NCA) said.
OL,16,FThe group took passports from migrants
OL,17,Fin France before they travelled to the
OL,18,FUK by small boats and lorries,
OL,19,Finvestigators said.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
