OL,3,GNEWSAPeople-smuggling gang used
OL,4,Apassports to control migrants
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to the NCA, the documents
OL,7,Fwere then used as a form of control
OL,8,Fwhile payments for the crossings were
OL,9,Fcollected and sent back to Vietnam.
